Package: MCube
Title: Identifying cell-type-specific spatially variable genes with the Mixture of Mixed Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Zhiwei", "Wang", , "zhiwei.wang@connect.ust.hk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7682-0070"))
Description:
    The R package MCube implements the methods in the MMM paper.
    MMM, standing for the Mixture of Mixed Models, is a unified framework for statistical identification of cell-type-specific spatially variable genes in spatial transcriptomic studies.
